  "reply": "根据附件文件《FBS_PM_29NOV2023_Public.pdf》的内容，文件中**没有明确表达“因员工留任问题导致机构知识流失”的担忧**。\n\n文件在“Bureau Cross-Cutting Management Goal 1”部分（第28页）提到了“improve knowledge management”（改进知识管理），并在“Bureau Cross-Cutting Management Objective 1.1 Risk Considerations”部分（第29-31页）讨论了人才流失风险，例如：“The Bureau may lose people due to burnout, lack of work-life flexibilities, and frustrations over lack of DEIA representation, career mobility, and professional development opportunities”以及“Without much-needed IT and data modernization and infrastructure upgrades, the Bureau also risks losing talent due to an inflexible work environment and/or health concerns”。\n\n然而，文件**并未将员工留任问题与机构知识流失直接关联起来**。文件分别讨论了人才保留/流失风险和知识管理改进，但没有明确表述“因员工留任问题导致机构知识流失”这一具体担忧。因此，该文件不包含对您所提问题的直接讨论。",
